WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — The Last Message — Episode 2 — English subtitles (PRIMARY dialogue, language: en)

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.000
The house was sold two months ago… why is the door open?

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Mama… I'm here. Like you asked.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Everything is just as it was… even the smell of the house.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Under the stairs… she said under the stairs.

5
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
A key? What is this key for?

6
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.000
The small drawer… it never opened when I was little.

7
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.000
A blue envelope… in Mama's handwriting.

8
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Open it, Layla… and read to the end.

9
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.000
A photo… torn in half.

10
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.000
That's me… when I was seven.

11
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
And the girl next to me… who is she?

12
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:08.000
She is your sister, Layla.
